<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ajiya debuts at 9.80 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ajiya debuts at 9.80 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Ajiya Bhd made their market debut at 9.80 ringgit against an offer price of 5.20.</p>
<p>The building materials maker and property firm offered 221,000 new shares and another 3.715 million vendor shares in its initial public offering.  </p>
<p>Ajiya, which is listed on the second board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange, estimated net profit of 10.83 million ringgit for the year ended November 30, 1996, against 7.08 million last year.</p>
<p>Around 20 minutes into the opening, the stock was at 9.15 ringgit. It has traded between 9.10 and 9.80 ringgit, on volume of 416,,000.</p>
